# Social image branding (Facebook + Instagram)

Every Sacred Ground social graphic for Autopilot / ML Social / Zernio **must** include:

1. **Sacred Ground circular logo** — `config/brand/sacred-ground-logo-circle-transparent.png`
2. **Short text overlay** on the photo (no black/dark panel behind text)
3. **Website + phone in a clean footer band under the photo** (always)

## Contact footer (required — always)

- Extend the canvas below the photo (cream/light band)
- Always include, centered and readable:
  - `shopsacredground.com`
  - `847-749-3922`
- Never place website/phone over busy photo areas (crystals, runes, faces, product)

## Type style (required)

- Mix fonts (chunky + hand + one script accent) — avoid one rigid template font everywhere
- **Readability first:** thick/bold type, true black on light images — **no white border/stroke/halo**
- Soft cream wash behind mid-photo text if needed (not a black box)
- Not every line arched — one playful curve is enough (e.g. TOMORROW)
- Feel original / shop-made, not store-bought Canva template

## Layout (required)

| Zone | Content |
|---|---|
| **Top (on photo)** | Campaign word — e.g. `TOMORROW` (morning) or `NEXT 7 DAYS` |
| **Middle (on photo)** | Who / what + day·time · Arlington Heights |
| **Below photo** | Footer band with website + phone |

## Contrast rule (required)

- **Light images (luma ≥ 140) → black text**
- **Dark images (luma < 140) → gold text**

## Single-image mode (required — Founder Aug 10, 2026)

- **Same media URL on Facebook and Instagram** for every campaign (morning, afternoon spotlight, week_ahead night, Tuesday meditation, etc.)
- Do not ship a weaker separate Instagram variant — one excellent plate for both

## Never reuse images (hard FINAL — Founder Aug 12 ~5:54pm CT)

- **An image should NEVER be reused** — not even practitioner/event/TEC thumbnails,
  Eve flyers, celestial plates, or morning flyers. Lifetime block via `image_usage`.
- Different campaigns / times of day MUST use different images. Morning 9am,
  afternoon 5pm, evening 7pm week_ahead, and Tuesday meditation are separate slots.
- FB+IG may share **one** plate for the **same** slot (single-image mode) — that is
  one post pair, not a “reuse.”
- Selecting a used URL must fail (`reuse_blocked`) and force alternate / regenerate /
  skip with a clear error — never silently reuse.
- Afternoon must never take the morning celestial / morning_flyer plate (Aug 12
  eclipse bug). Tomorrow must not pull today’s Eve flyer URL.
- Code: `marketing.images.never_reuse_urls` / `urls_ever_used` /
  `cooldown_blocked_urls` + afternoon / week_ahead / tuesday `plan_image` paths.
- Shared FB+IG plates must be Instagram feed-safe aspect (**0.75–1.91**, prefer **4:5**).
  Taller Story/TikTok ratios (e.g. 2:3 / 0.67) fail IG publish.
- **NEW gens:** designed-in shop pride required (`designed_in_required`) — see
  `.cursor/rules/social-proof-on-image.mdc`.

## Color energy (required — Founder Aug 10, 2026)

- Creatives must be **colorful, bright, interesting, engaging** — jewel tones, strong contrast, something worth stopping for
- **Forbidden:** drab, muddy, beige, grey, desaturated purple AI sludge, empty near-black voids, low-saturation washes
- Dark plates need bright accents (gold / emerald / amethyst / teal / amber), not a flat muddy field

## Logo

- Circular only; strip black/square background to true transparency
- **Darker translucent** — about **80–90% opacity** (a smidge darker than a faint watermark; still not fully opaque)
- Corner mark ~10–13% of image width; prefer bottom-left of the **photo** area (above footer)
- Logo does **not** replace on-image event text

## Caption (platform text under the post)

- Warm experience language + clickable booking/event link
- Phone/site may also appear in caption; footer on the graphic is still required

## Morning post (9:00 AM America/Chicago)

- Campaign key `today` (CLI `publish-today`) promotes **today’s full day**
  (`include_publish_day: true`) **then tomorrow** (`target_offset_days: 1`)
- Never evening-only / “tonight” filtering at 9am — daytime sessions must appear
- Caption opener: today-first when today has events; tomorrow-only if today empty
- On-image word: `TODAY` when flyer is publish-day; `TOMORROW` when tomorrow-only
- Schedule: `09:00` America/Chicago (do not flip to 10:00 unless Founder asks)

## Daily week-ahead (7:00 PM America/Chicago)

- Campaign `week_ahead`: next **2** calendar days starting tomorrow
  (`horizon_start_offset_days: 1`, `horizon_days: 2`, `include_same_day_evening: false`)
  — Sat 7pm → Sun+Mon; never the publish day’s full slate or tonight’s leftovers
- Background: night creative from `config/image_atmosphere.json` (sky / storefront /
  holiday / full moon) — **the photo itself must carry a Sacred Ground visual anchor**
  (storefront, logo-sun / bat-signal, glowing “Sacred Ground” in the landscape).
  Pure generic aurora/sky with no SG cue is not enough. See `night-image-sacred-ground.mdc`.
- Overlay logo + campaign text + cream footer still apply for non-prebranded plates;
  overlays do **not** replace the in-photo SG identity requirement
- Same footer rule: website + phone under the image
